# Payment safety (pre-Live)

Until a **dedicated Live-activation task**:

- `LIVE_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=false`
- Stripe financial ops **TEST** only
- Do not enable Live as a side effect of UI, fee, ticket, test, deploy, or env cleanup

`getStripeMode()` currently forces TEST even if the env flag is flipped. Do not remove that refuse without an explicit Live task.

## PCI

Never put raw PAN/CVC in scripts, APIs, or tests. Browser cards: Stripe.js / Payment Element. Automated Stripe: official TEST PaymentMethod IDs, mocks, or fixtures.

## Connect

Sourcer/seller destination = **that user’s own** Connect account (`txn.sellerId` / `ticket.sellerId`). Never default other sellers to a historical Connect account. Buyers do not need Connect merely to buy.

## QA

Do not create PaymentIntent / Charge / Transfer / Refund / payout unless the task explicitly requires TEST financial verification. Ordinary ticket/UI work: no Stripe money objects.

## Guard

`npm run test:live-guard` must pass the pre-Live regression. Changing Live flags requires an explicit Live-activation task.
